    "summary_one_sentence": "An animated epic following David, a humble shepherd whose unshakable faith and courage guide him from defeating the formidable giant Goliath to facing trials that shape the destiny of an entire kingdom.",
    "summary_short": "Beginning in quiet devotion as a simple shepherd, young David's life changes forever when the giant Goliath threatens his nation. Armed only with a sling, a few stones, and deep faith in God, he boldly steps forward to confront the giant when others falter. As his miraculous victory brings both acclaim and dangerous opposition, David must navigate trials of loyalty, love, and resilience. Ultimately, his journey becomes a fight not just for a crown, but for the soul of his kingdom.",
    "summary_long": "David's journey begins in the tranquil fields, where his days are filled with humble devotion, family bonds, and a steadfast faith in God. When the fearsome giant Goliath emerges to terrorize the nation, none of Israel's seasoned warriors dare to challenge him. Moved by divine purpose rather than worldly ambition, the young shepherd steps forward armed only with his sling, a handful of stones, and unshakable trust. David's remarkable victory over Goliath instantly transforms him into a national hero, but it also thrusts him into a perilous realm of political rivalry and royal envy. Pursued by powerful foes who feel threatened by his destiny, David must rely on his inner strength, wisdom, and faith to survive. Throughout his ongoing trials, he forms deep bonds of love and friendship while enduring profound tests of courage and selflessness. Each conflict refines his spirit, teaching him the high personal cost of true leadership and integrity. Facing relentless threats both internal and external, David stands firm against adversity to protect those he loves. Ultimately, his heroic path culminates in a monumental struggle that will decide the ultimate destiny and spiritual foundation of the entire realm.",
    "synopsis": "Rooted in devotion, family, and history, 'David' tells the timeless animated story of a humble shepherd boy who rises to become a legendary figure. Guided by faith and the melodic wisdom of his mother's heart, David leads a peaceful life until the arrival of Goliath, a colossal warrior who strikes terror across the nation. Where experienced armies falter in fear, David relies on his spiritual resolve, stepping up to challenge the giant with only a simple sling and a few stones. His unexpected triumph ignites a grander story of purpose, adventure, and hardship as powerful forces seek to thwart his ultimate calling. Blending historical drama with family-oriented storytelling, this narrative explores profound themes of love, loyalty, and divine perseverance, capturing a young hero's quest to heal and lead his kingdom.",
